  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The oil drop experiment was to measure the specific charge of an electron.</p><p>Davisson &amp; Germer&nbsp;experiment proved the wave nature of electrons.</p><p>Rutherford experiment proved the presence of a nucleus, while&nbsp;the Franck-Hertz experiment established&nbsp;the Quantisation of energy levels.</p>",
